{"id":"en_ceo-s-wife-s-multiple-identities","title":"CEO's Wife's Multiple Identities","titleEn":"CEO's Wife's Multiple Identities","description":"Chloe Qin takes a job at her own company, where nobody recognizes her, and Ethan Lu quietly watches over her from the sidelines. She makes it clear to him that he must not disclose that she is the CEO's wife. When two newcomers join the staff on her first day, the assumption spreads that the glamorous Mona Gong must be the CEO's wife, which sets off a string of misunderstandings. For those who want to follow how these mix-ups unfold, the series can be watched on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/ceos-wifes-multiple-identities/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/ceos-wifes-multiple-identities/en_US/e34db6d32d7c0298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Pretending to be weak to deceive others","Office Romance","Hidden Identity","CEO","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d1agq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_ceo-s-wife-s-multiple-identities_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d1agq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-s-wife-s-multiple-identities_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d1agq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-s-wife-s-multiple-identities_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d1agq/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ceo-s-wife-s-multiple-identities_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (